{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/02/04/4144576/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/02/04/4144576/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい(今日)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、お風呂いれようと\n洗面所に行ったらお母さんが\n中田リズム(歯磨きしながら腰回すやつ)\nやってて目をそらしてしまいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月に入りましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンザが流行っています...\nみなさん大丈夫ですか？\nうがい手洗いうがいですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/02/04/4144576/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウンのアイシャドウを\n目の周りに塗りたくって撮ったら\n全部ホラーだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまお誕生日おめでとう！\nひなちまとはお母さん共々仲良し。\n頭良くてしっかりしてて色気あって\nまだ16歳ですよ。\nこの先どうなっちゃうんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無造作なまりかがすきだよ\nと言ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/02/04/4144576/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からかうな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/02/04/4144576/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近水彩画はまってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は心臓描きました。\n昨日は目を描きました。\n今から耳描きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}